  "idea": "Framer vs Webflow: which visual website builder should you build on",
  "text": "Elite digital designers are migrating from Webflow to Framer for rapid client marketing pages. Juggling manual CSS resets and strict breakpoint overrides in Webflow turns simple builds into slow engineering bottlenecks. Handoff friction between creative Figma components and Webflow's rigid box model delays campaign launches. Framer eliminates development friction with direct Figma pasting, built-in interactive states, and instant publishing. You deliver client websites in record time.",
